{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Configure the legend of a project map and its entries. expectedSpecVersion is required to prevent stale writes.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"expectedSpecVersion":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"input":{"properties":{"layerId":{"description":"The ID of the layer.","type":"string"},"legend":{"anyOf":[{"properties":{"caption":{"type":"string"},"displayName":{"description":"Layer label shown in the legend. Defaults to the current legend label or layer ID.","type":"string"},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"interactive":{"description":"When true, clicking legend items filters the map.","type":"boolean"},"items":{"description":"Explicit legend items. Each item MUST have: id (unique string), label, type (one of \"symbol\", \"line\", \"fill\", \"gradient\", \"choropleth\"), and a style object. Match type to the layer geometry: use \"line\" for line layers, \"fill\" for polygon layers, \"symbol\" for point layers. Line style: { color: \"#hex\", width?: number, dashArray?: [number], opacity?: 0-1 }. Fill style: { fillColor: \"#hex\", outlineColor?: \"#hex\", fillOpacity?: 0-1 }. Symbol style: { color?: \"#hex\", iconImage?: string, iconSize?: number, strokeColor?: \"#hex\" }. Use canonical symbol:uuid refs for custom symbol icons. Example line item: { id: \"trunk\", label: \"Trunk\", type: \"line\", style: { color: \"#8B0000\", width: 3 } }","items":{"oneOf":[{"properties":{"id":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"interactive":{"type":"boolean"},"label":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"style":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"color":{"pattern":"^#[0-9a-f]{6}$","type":"string"},"iconImage":{"type":"string"},"iconSize":{"type":"number"},"opacity":{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"strokeColor":{"pattern":"^#[0-9a-f]{6}$","type":"string"},"strokeWidth":{"type":"n